    {
      "id": "exam/edexcel-8fm0-01-2020-october/q2",
      "question": "<p>Given that</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"z_1 = 2 + 3i\" data-display=\"true\"></div><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\left| z_1 z_2 \\right| = 39\\sqrt{2}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\arg(z_1 z_2) = \\frac{\\pi}{4}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z_1\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z_2\"></span> are complex numbers,</p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(a) write <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z_1\"></span> in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r(\\cos \\theta + i \\sin \\theta)\"></span></p><p>Give the exact value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r\"></span> and give the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\theta\"></span> in radians to 4 significant figures.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(b) Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z_2\"></span> giving your answer in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a + i b\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\"></span> are integers.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(6)</span></p>",
