      "id": "exam/edexcel-8fm0-01-2020-october/q8",
      "question": "<p>Prove by induction that, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n \\in \\mathbb{Z}^+\"></span></p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(n) = 2^{n+2} + 3^{2n+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>is divisible by 7</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(6)</span></p>",
